  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "Given equation: 7 - 3 ÷ 9 × 2 + 4 = 5.\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) 2 and 9\n\nGiven: 7 - 3 ÷ 9 × 2 + 4 = 5\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 7 - __**3 ÷ 2**__ × 9 + 4 = 5\n\n⇒ 7 - __**1.5 × 9**__ + 4 = 5\n\n⇒ __**7**__ - 13.5 __**+ 4**__ = 5\n\n⇒ __**11 - 13.5**__ = 5\n\n⇒ -2.5 ≠ 5\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 2) 4 and 2\n\nGiven: 7 - 3 ÷ 9 × 2 + 4 = 5\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 7 - __**3 ÷ 9**__ × 4 + 2 = 5\n\n⇒ 7 - __**0.333 × 4**__ + 2 = 5\n\n⇒ __**7**__ - 1.332 __**+ 2**__ = 5\n\n⇒ **__9__**__** - 1.332**__ = 5\n\n⇒ 7.668 ≠ 5\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) 7 and 4\n\nGiven: 7 - 3 ÷ 9 × 2 + 4 = 5\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 4 - __**3 ÷ 9**__ × 2 + 7 = 5\n\n⇒ 4 - __**0.333 × 2**__ + 7 = 5\n\n⇒ __**4**__ - 0.666 __**+ 7**__ = 5\n\n⇒ **__11__**__** - 0.666**__ = 5\n\n⇒ 10.334 ≠ 5\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n**Option 4) 3 and 9**\n\nGiven: 7 - 3 ÷ 9 × 2 + 4 = 5\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 7 - __**9 ÷ 3**__ × 2 + 4 = 5\n\n⇒ 7 - __**3 × 2**__ + 4 = 5\n\n⇒ __**7**__ - 6 __**+ 4**__ = 5\n\n⇒ __**11 - 6**__ = 5\n\n⇒** 5 = 5**\n\n⇒ **LHS = RHS**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option 4\"**.",
